<title>FINLAND: Finnish T-bill auction raises FIM 405 mln.</title>
<headline>Finnish T-bill auction raises FIM 405 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the State Treasury Office's T-Bill auction December 10 versus December 3.</p>
<p>		     THIS AUCTION/PREVIOUS AUCTION</p>
<p> Maturity, days    92/99	337/344</p>
<p> Avge yld, pct   3.03/3.02   3.34/3.33</p>
<p> Highest yld     3.03/3.02   3.34/3.34</p>
<p> Lowest  yld     3.02/3.01   3.33/3.33</p>
<p> Amount, FIM million  240/183     165/1,318</p>
<p> Bids, FIM million    260/239     165/1,900</p>
<p>Total planned issue amount was 1.5 billion markka. After today's auction, the outstanding amount of treasury bills is 40,007 million markka, the STO said.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0245</p>
</text>
